<section class="navigation-home" aria-labelledby="navigation-home-title"><div class="nav-home-shell"><div class="nav-home-intro"><div class="nav-home-kicker"><span class="eyebrow">Privatpraxis · Düsseldorf Oberkassel</span></div><h1 class="display" id="navigation-home-title">{{ copy.home.title | escape }}</h1><p>{{ copy.home.intro | escape }}</p><div class="nav-home-note">Für diese Orientierung brauchen wir keine medizinischen Angaben.</div></div><div class="nav-home-router"><span class="eyebrow">Ihre Orientierung</span><h2 class="display">Was führt Sie zu uns?</h2><p>Wählen Sie die Situation, die gerade am besten passt. Die passenden nächsten Wege öffnen sich direkt an dieser Auswahl.</p><div class="intent-choices" role="group" aria-label="Besucherstatus auswählen">
{% for intent in intents %}<div class="intent-item"><button class="intent-choice" type="button" data-intent-button="{{ intent.key }}" aria-pressed="false" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="intent-{{ intent.key }}"><span class="intent-index">{{ intent.index }}</span><strong>{{ intent.label }}</strong><span class="intent-arrow" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="intent-panel" id="intent-{{ intent.key }}" data-intent-panel="{{ intent.key }}" hidden><div class="intent-panel-title">{{ intent.panelTitle }}</div><div class="intent-routes">{% for route in intent.routes %}<a class="intent-route" href="{{ route.href }}" data-intent-route="{{ route.route }}"><span>{{ route.label }}</span><span>↗</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></div>
{% endfor %}</div></div></div></section>
